<!--
    ic_apple_casting.xml — Apple Casting (AirPlay screen mirroring) card icon.

    A TV with the four-step "casting" arc in the corner: the same shape family as a phone's
    Screen Mirroring button, drawn in the app's palette so it reads at 10 feet.
-->
